<newsitem itemid="20297" id="root" date="1996-08-28" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Domnick Hunter year pretax surges 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Domnick Hunter year pretax surges 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.04		   vs 6.54</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.88		   vs 2.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.2		    vs 3.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   25.7		   vs 21.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Domnick Hunter, a UK manufacturer of air filters and dryers for compressed air and gases, said the second half of the year had started well and should lead to a satisfactory outcome for the year as a whole.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 4.33		   vs 3.47</p>
<p> Interest payable	 0.17		   vs 0.15</p>
<p> Tax charge		 1.44		   vs 1.15</p>
<p> Net taxed		  2.79		   vs 2.26</p>
<p> Retained profit	  1.83		   vs 1.48</p>
<p> Pay date		   Oct 18</p>
<p>Div registration date  Sept 17  Ex-div date		Sept 9</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
